{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-36","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-36"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-36-talk-403813801-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-36","missionId":"event-rogue-36","mission":"선물 교환하자","scene":"선물 교환하자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"무명객의 열차가 뒤쪽 칸에 무한한 보물을 싣고 부다아넬리 승강장에 멈추었다. 초라한 행색에 털 부츠에는 진흙이 묻은 채로 페도라를 쓴 여행자가 열차 칸 앞에 몸을 기대고 있다","talkId":403813801,"textHash":"3505521498548446437","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:36/talk-403813801","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"7dc2f4323fc135c4","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-36-talk-403813802-line"],"bwikiPage":"来交换礼物吧","bwikiRevision":95595,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8727","bwikiMission":"선물 교환하자"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-36-talk-403813802-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-36","missionId":"event-rogue-36","mission":"선물 교환하자","scene":"선물 교환하자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신이 열차 칸에 다가가자 그가 당신에게 손을 흔든다. 「예전에 아키비리는 일반인으로 변장해 부다아넬리인들과 함께 개척 모험에 나섰었지. 우린 여행 중에 있었던 재미있는 경험들을 서로 얘기했었어」","talkId":403813802,"textHash":"7324196349649321380","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:36/talk-403813802","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"7dc2f4323fc135c4","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"来交换礼物吧","bwikiRevision":95595,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8727","bwikiMission":"선물 교환하자"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-36-text-18433386777241106097-choice","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-36","missionId":"event-rogue-36","mission":"선물 교환하자","scene":"선물 교환하자","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"축복 재주조","talkId":null,"textHash":"18433386777241106097","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:36/text-18433386777241106097","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","